WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.047
Eddy was on the bridge.

2
00:00:11.048 --> 00:00:15.502
"This bridge isn't scary," he thought.

3
00:00:15.503 --> 00:00:19.196
Some birds flew by.

4
00:00:19.197 --> 00:00:23.375
"Birds aren't scary," Eddy thought.

5
00:00:23.376 --> 00:00:26.880
A wind blew.

6
00:00:26.881 --> 00:00:30.783
"Wind isn't scary," Eddy thought.

7
00:00:30.784 --> 00:00:35.846
Then a stronger wind blew.

8
00:00:35.847 --> 00:00:38.545
The bridge shook!

9
00:00:38.546 --> 00:00:42.329
"Ahh!" Eddy screamed.

10
00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:44.891
He spun his tires.

11
00:00:44.892 --> 00:00:55.799
And he shot across the bridge!

12
00:00:55.800 --> 00:01:01.221
Eddy stopped on the other side.

13
00:01:01.222 --> 00:01:04.799
"Whew!" said Eddy.

14
00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:06.920
"I'm safe!"

15
00:01:06.921 --> 00:01:14.573
Eddy looked back.

16
00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:18.000
Poppy drove onto the bridge.

17
00:01:18.001 --> 00:01:24.482
Everyone else followed Poppy.

18
00:01:24.483 --> 00:01:28.809
Soon everyone was on Eddy's side.

19
00:01:28.810 --> 00:01:33.585
"Thanks, Eddy," said Poppy.

20
00:01:33.586 --> 00:01:37.470
"You were very brave.

21
00:01:37.471 --> 00:01:42.273
You made us brave!"

22
00:01:42.274 --> 00:01:46.476
"Well done, Eddy," said Ms. Fender.

23
00:01:46.477 --> 00:01:50.832
Eddy grinned.

